# Real PEM keys must never be committed.
# Cross-SDK test fixture key pair lives under tests/.../fixtures/cross-sdk/
# and is intentionally checked in — it's a throw-away RSA-2048 pair shared
# with the Java, Python, and .NET SDKs solely for the JWE round-trip
# fixtures.
*.pem
!tests/fixtures/cross-sdk/*.pem
